{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51383","headline":"长揖诗（贞元中，刘忠州任大夫科选，多滥进。有无名子自云山东野客，移书於刘，附长揖诗曰：） · 山东野客","name":"长揖诗（贞元中，刘忠州任大夫科选，多滥进。有无名子自云山东野客，移书於刘，附长揖诗曰：）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三铨选客不须嗔，五个登科各有因。\n无识伯和怜吉獠，弄权虞候爲王申。\n载华甲第归丞相，裴子门徒入舍人。\n莫怪邵南书判好，他家自有景监亲。\n（《唐摭言》十三《无名子谤议》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"山东野客","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}